{"about_the_game":"<p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Lumen: The Last Hope</strong> is a story-driven adventure where you absorb light around you. Each color grants a unique ability that helps you explore the mysterious world and overcome its challenges. But light comes at a cost: every time you use an ability, you lose health, forcing you to think carefully about when and how to use your powers.</p><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Core Abilities</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Red \u2013 Strength:</strong> Push and move heavy objects.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Yellow \u2013 Revelation:</strong> Reveal hidden objects, paths, and clues.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Purple \u2013 Distraction:</strong> Distract enemies and slip past danger.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Blue \u2013 Time Slow:</strong> Manipulate time to outsmart traps and puzzles.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Orange \u2013 Conduit:</strong> Grants access to Red and Yellow abilities.</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" ><strong>Green \u2013 Heal:</strong> Restore health after spending it on powers.</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" >Key Features</h2><ul class=\"bb_ul\"><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Story-Driven Adventure</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Puzzle Variety</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Reactive World</p></li><li><p class=\"bb_paragraph\" >Single-Player Focus</p></li></ul><h2 class=\"bb_tag\" ></h2>","background":"https://store.akamai.steamstatic.com/images/storepagebackground/app/3981540?t=1761568210","background_raw":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981540/777017b9c5b35b3add40e70cd87e4c25ad4c1b80/page_bg_raw.jpg?t=1761568210","capsule_image":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/store_item_assets/steam/apps/3981540/4a83dff07901448db1dbfb7e48b3df873c52acce/capsule_231x87.jpg?t=1761568210","capsule_imagev5":"https://shared.akamai.steamstatic.com/